<title>USA: ProNet reschedules earnings release.</title>
<headline>ProNet reschedules earnings release.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>ProNet Inc on Thursday said it would reschedule the release of its quarterly and annual earnings report, which had been expected Thursday morning.</p>
<p>The paging company said it was in the process of finalizing the report and would announce the new date &quot;within the next week.&quot;</p>
</text>
